技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104133958799360813542.jpeg/CoOtHoiJ9daRQTR-reNazNUyA0BOUorv-2RSf_tkUn8\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104136601341952569374.jpeg/YHJWgrn41suFEvWqVi8XXF4W9mbr3_P8f9dIFH_XSBQ\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104139038363648329687.jpeg/roPNVrhIZyNUtDIBEmZfDq58qPwzoA61RE6gREROoEQ\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104141378916352107349.jpeg/FtUKspNoU6YtX0Ny7pqxshR31xoEPBFZyeycAsnsnAI\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104143794966528469352.jpeg/-KgAHzwMnmR20c5yjuvY7WLxQ-_PUmSpT9VH20_VR9s\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104146122936320263054.jpeg/fGIhMFA-kz5XpH1HUV7XLEVR2W5rqAliFkwaNxZMGjc\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104148740313088045396.jpeg/C9RYb3F_NhgTB7lL0ByeUT9UspV9kYuX4iD_7-Ig_-8\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104126115057664382640.jpeg/YP9GlWSVDkKd3JVJG58k588SeXPIgsTU9oPWQfaD1kE\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104128753405952928614.jpeg/jAJhMqi8Dk8GNMREFNL6fe8rSW7loDXfBVn_qAVZ_6g\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104130972323840521463.jpeg/__XUyAdspVBJeQDziKX7LhLRbgfEwmnShib2PoYm9j4\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104133044441088659830.jpeg/EQrQqHjuVub8TGJgBNq94UBe_5ixjjR8w_TdR8P03Uc\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104135762481152309158.jpeg/Ezyr8vWv5udwLOhj3_GliKmmlWDACxwA7ZnmLO2Z5iw\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104137926873088312650.jpeg/WgLKPxU5cw5V9kOEqOoFdKWE7Ltytrw326ejktuno5I\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104140565221376586412.jpeg/QK7kwkXJf1b_n8SsMC1HezG0dDHoxckcMg9M3TIPTN0\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230222/705104142905774080936208.jpeg/8QhADiIcNc4oJ3xptKNaSu68wW6-CN02k1r62JNa-tg\"/><figcaption>ChatGPT 6大職場應用技巧（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>但專家並未全盤否定AI的價值。AI仍能有效協助投資人快速分析大量財報、年報等資料，也可先利用AI縮小問題範圍，再向按時計費的理財顧問諮詢，以節省時間與費用。</p><p>另一個值得注意的重點是責任歸屬。許多真人理財顧問依法負有受託責任，必須以客戶最佳利益行事；但若採納AI提供的投資建議而蒙受損失，投資人幾乎沒有追究對象，最終仍須自行承擔後果。</p><p>延伸閲讀：</p><p>美國大眾為何恨AI？克魯曼：不僅因害怕失業、科技業「屎化」而已</p><p>兩天就能賺10億美元 最新報告：AI營收已達支應成本轉捩點</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-26T09:20:27.183704+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1740,"images":38,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}